Package: evaluably
Title: Explicit Claim-Scoped Measurement Audit Declarations
Version: 0.9.0
Authors@R: person("Zichen", "Sheng", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "225113177+ZichenSheng@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Executes explicitly declared, claim-scoped measurement audits with
    ordered preflight gates, callback dependency verification, constructibility
    censuses, unordered qualification states and constrained interpretation
    licences. Produces canonical evidence records and labelled denominator counts.
    Scientific declarations and thresholds are supplied by the analyst.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: rlang, digest, jsonlite, codetools, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, withr, callr, yaml, covr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/ZichenSheng/evaluably
BugReports: https://github.com/ZichenSheng/evaluably/issues
